{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Well, to say that the calamity signs went away would be slightly incorrect.": "",
  "...It's that I no longer have the ability see them.": "",
  "Wait... you lost your powers?": "",
  "Not permanently. This has happened occasionally in the past...": "",
  "And it always seemed to occur when I was faced with a major obstacle.": "",
  "Hmm. Any idea what that is?": "",
  "I'm afraid not. Work is going well, and my personal life...": "",
  "...My personal life is also very fulfilling.": "",
  "So nothing's weighing on your mind?": "",
  "Correct.": "",
  "Yet you still can't see the signs. I wonder what's causing this.": "",
  "...It seems I cannot discern that either.": "",
  "What are you gonna do from here on out?": "",
  "...I think it would be best to wait and observe how things develop.": "",
  "But is there really anything to observe at the moment?": "",
  "...W-Well, that is true... However, I...": "",
  "(She's acting kind of odd.)": "",
  "What do you want to do, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Personally, I want to keep seeing you.": "",
  "T-Truly!? That would be... wonderful.": "",
  "I'm glad you understand.": "",
  "Are things going okay with that patron of yours?": "",
  "...He seems rather pleased with me. I imagine he wants to continue using my services.": "",
  "Well, you do have a certain charm about you.": "",
  "I do? Because I'm certainly not aware of it...": "",
  "Yeah. You give off this mysterious... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>bewitching</font_kind> sort of vibe.": "",
  "He's still the head of a yakuza family, though. I'm kinda worried.": "",
  "Oh, I don't think there's anything to be concerned about. Besides, they're depending on me right now.": "",
  "I see. Just be careful.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san, the time has come for me to depart. There is still much work to be done...": "",
  "Okay. But I thought you couldn't see the calamity signs anymore? Can you still work like that?": "",
  "...I suppose you have a point.": "",
  "...Well, in any case, I'll walk you to your meeting spot.": "",
  "Thank you for spending time with me today, Yagami-san. I had a wonderful time.": "",
  "Glad to hear it. I hope you feel better soon.": "",
  "Conversing with you certainly helps. It's strangely relaxing.": "",
  "Well, I'm here for you anytime.": "",
  "I must apologize, Yagami-san. For constantly making you worry.": "",
  "No, I'm glad we talked. You feeling any better?": "",
  "Hmm... On the contrary, I'm feeling rather... dispirited.": "",
  "(Damn. I guess I couldn't cheer her up.)": "",
  "All right, Tsumugi-san, let's get this show on the road!": "",
  "Hey. You.": "",
  "...That's what I'd like to know.": "",
  "Anyway. You ready, Tsumugi-san?": "",
  "I am. Farewell, Yagami-san...": "",
  "(Is that guy... watching me?)": "",
  "I apologize for being so late... and for failing to respond on top of that.": "",
  "It's okay. I'm just glad to see you, Amane-san.": "",
  "How about we find somewhere to sit down and talk for a bit?": "",
  "Well, want to get going? I'll walk you halfway.": "",
  "All right. If anything weird happens from here on out, you be sure to let me know.": "",
  "Um. Amane-san?": "",
  "...I realized something while talking with you today.": "",
  "Perhaps there is a... shortcut, if you will, to solving this matter.": "",
  "Something that should solve all my concerns at once. But it requires... determination.": "",
  "All right. But promise me you'll listen all the way through!": "",
  "You want me to be your... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>special</font_kind> partner?": "",
  "Yes. And I don't mean that in the workplace aspect, either.": "",
  "(I figured as much.)": "",
  "I'm sorry. But I don't think I can return those feelings.": "",
  "Your confession makes me happy and all, don't get me wrong... I'm just not in a position to be your full-time man.": "",
  "Then I suppose I should say no more.": "",
  "Hope you're not too disappointed.": "",
  "No. I'm not. In fact, I think my concern is finally resolved.": "",
  "I'll no longer be troubled by you, so...": "",
  "Farewell. For good.": "",
  "(Yeah... Unfortunately, this is how it's supposed to be.)": "",
  "Let's be partners, then. No contracts, no paperwork. Just love.": "",
  "You set my heart aflutter every time.": "",
  "Tell me. Were you able to foresee this when you first met me?": "",
  "No, not at all. I can only see the fate of other people... Whereas my own remains a mystery.": "",
  "Heh. I guess that'd spoil all the fun, huh?": "",
  "*chuckle* I suppose you're right.": "",
  "...What's this?": "",
  "I can see.": "",
  "You can see? Does that mean...?": "",
  "Yes! I can see... the signs of calamity!": "",
  "Whoa. So your powers have returned?": "",
  "Yes! And furthermore...": "",
  "Yours has disappeared.": "",
  "This really was the shortcut after all.": "",
  "Well, we're the ultimate pair. There's nothing for us to fear as long as we stay together.": "",
  "I truly believe that no calamity, no disaster—not even fate itself—can break the power of our bonds.": "",
  "You know what? You're right. I feel like nothing can faze me now.": "",
  "I'm glad I could muster the courage to take this final step. Being close to your heart means everything to me.": "",
  "Amane-san...": "",
  "I'm sure that Ushimata-san won't hold anything against you, now that my powers have returned.": "",
  "Yeah. I'm no longer in the way of a good reading, I guess.": "",
  "But if you run into any trouble with him, you make sure to call me. I'll be there.": "",
  "Then... I'll be counting on you.": "",
  "(So, Tsumugi-san and I are now the ultimate pair... I like the sound of that.)": "",
  "So do you think that guy you mentioned believes in your abilities now?": "",
  "Yes. If anything, he was deeply impressed.": "",
  "In fact, he asked me to keep reading his fortune from now on.": "",
  "Wow, so you got yourself a regular. Nice going.": "",
  "Yes. He even paid me for my services. I declined at first, of course, but he kept on insisting.": "",
  "It was... quite a handsome reward.": "",
  "How much was it?": "",
  "About... 500,000 yen.": "",
  "He said that was only a trifle, considering I saved his life.": "",
  "He even wants to bring me in as one of his advisors. Similar to a court magician, I suppose...": "",
  "So he's gonna be your patron, huh? That's amazing.": "",
  "Indeed. I'm actually supposed to meet him afterward. He wants me to take a reading of everyone who works for him.": "",
  "You're going by yourself? Do you even know him that well?": "",
  "Believe me, I appreciate your concern. But I'll be fine.": "",
  "I'm used to such situations by now.": "",
  "I see. Be careful then.": "",
  "Hmm. I'm kinda jealous.": "",
  "...You are?": "",
  "Just a little.": "",
  "Ahaha. Worry not, Yagami-san. This man is far out of my age range.": "",
  "It feels a lot like we've been dating lately, rather than trying to lure out a cow.": "",
  "However... if we keep dropping our guard like this, the cow might choose to manifest itself.": "",
  "Then let's put on our cowboy hats and wrangle the sucker in.": "",
  "*chuckle* Let's do that.": "",
  "...Yagami-san, do you... find my company enjoyable?": "",
  "Oh yeah. I always have fun hanging out with you.": "",
  "Do you speak the truth?": "",
  "Yep. Cross my heart.": "",
  "I never would have imagined...": "",
  "Absolutely. What about you, Amane-san?": "",
  "Well, I certainly appreciate your company...": "",
  "Do you mean that in terms of work? Or...": "",
  "...It was like that at first. But now... I appreciate you in general.": "",
  "How about I guess the occupation of that patron of yours?": "",
  "You can really do that?": "",
  "Sure. All it takes is a simple game.": "",
  "Of what game do you speak?": "",
  "I'm just gonna ask you a few questions, and all you need to do is think about the answers. That's pretty much it.": "",
  "You don't require any verbal response at all?": "",
  "Nope. Just think carefully.": "",
  "(People generally make unconscious gestures when they're lying...)": "",
  "(I bet I can throw a few questions out there and gauge her responses that way.)": "",
  "So, this gentleman's occupation...": "",
  "I think I'll remain silent.": "",
  "So he isn't a businessman, then?": "",
  "Oh? Did I see you waver a bit just now?": "",
  "S-Surely you're mistaken!": "",
  "(Got her. Heh, she's not so hard to read.)": "",
  "I wonder if I can guess the first letter of his occupation.": "",
  "Is it A?": "",
  "You tell me.": "",
  "So it's not A? Then maybe...": "",
  "(I see.)": "",
  "Can you really tell from just that?": "",
  "Oh, you'll see.": "",
  "I'm gonna throw out some general characteristics here, based on what he does.": "",
  "Don't expect an answer.": "",
  "This guy's an intellectual.": "",
  "Maybe someone who sits all day.": "",
  "Or could he be someone who moves around a lot?": "",
  "Perhaps he's good with his hands.": "",
  "A generally cheerful fellow.": "",
  "Or maybe he's a little more on the shady side.": "",
  "He could be a creator.": "",
  "Heck, he could be something anyone would know.": "",
  "Okay, I got it.": "",
  "What!": "",
  "That patron of yours... is...": "",
  "The head of a yakuza family.": "",
  "Whaaat!? H-How did you know?": "",
  "Simple observation, my dear Amane-san.": "",
  "...Although, all I really did was copy what I saw on a TV drama the other day.": "",
  "Either way, being able to pull that off takes a considerable amount of skill.": "",
  "A yoga instructor?": "",
  "Ahaha, that would be pretty interesting.": "",
  "Okay, hold on. I know I got this...": "",
  "A yacht broker?": "",
  "Hmm. He is quite wealthy...": "",
  "But dang, a yakuza patriarch, huh?": "",
  "Yes. That is why he seems to attract danger quite frequently.": "",
  "Yeah. Now it all adds up.": "",
  "His organization seems to be involved with some sort of conflict as of late...": "",
  "So having me predict his misfortunes is proving to be quite an asset.": "",
  "No wonder he wants to keep such a reliable person around.": "",
  "How are you doing with the calamity signs and all?": "",
  "...Nothing has changed. I am still unable to perceive them.": "",
  "Which means you're still worried about something.": "",
  "I just don't understand...": "",
  "I thought everything would go back to normal if I cut all contact with you.": "",
  "I guess it wasn't that easy.": "",
  "Yagami-san. You know if we continue to meet like this... your life might be forfeit once again.": "",
  "Then it's best that we don't—": "",
  "But it'd be even more problematic if I never saw you again.": "",
  "If a calamity does appear, I'll just have to find a way around it. Like I always do.": "",
  "But this is not a matter you can simply leave to fate...": "",
  "Right. It's my job to put these kinds of problems to rest. So rest assured, I'll be just fine.": "",
  "Yeah. I'll just have to take the bull by the horns on this one.": "",
  "So... \"The Obstinate Ox of Kamurocho\" was the calamity this whole time. How appropriate.": "",
  "...Yes. And I'm the one who brought him to your doorstep.": "",
  "Ridiculous, is it not? How I would keep meeting you, hoping to repel your calamity, or at least a portion of it...": "",
  "Yet, because of my selfish actions, I ended up bringing him right to you.": "",
  "But if it weren't for your predictions, we never would've met in the first place.": "",
  "...That may be so.": "",
  "Come to think of it... this cow calamity's been keeping us together this whole time, hasn't it?": "",
  "I'll have to shake it's hand when I meet it. Or... hoof, I guess.": "",
  "You're so positive, Yagami-san.": "",
  "But still, this cow's been nothing but a pain in the ass. Too bad we can't just lasso him in.": "",
  "I don't think ropes will do the trick on this one...": "",
  "Then there goes my chance to be a cowboy.": "",
  "Hey. When you said we shouldn't see each other anymore... Were you serious?": "",
  "I was.": "",
  "As our paths intertwine, so does your misfortune draw near.": "",
  "At this rate, I cannot guarantee the safety of your life. That is why I suggest such drastic measures.": "",
  "But if your powers come back, Ushimata won't have anything to complain about. Right?": "",
  "I'm sure if that was the case, then yes, he'd be fine...": "",
  "But... what if my visions never return? Then what would I do...?": "",
  "(She seems really stressed over this...)": "",
  "Would your concern really go away if we stopped seeing each other?": "",
  "...Perhaps, if given enough time. But I cannot say for sure.": "",
  "Is that really what you want, though?": "",
  "That's... difficult to answer...": "",
  "...That's correct.": "",
  "Do you not feel similarly?": "",
  "Well... to put it bluntly, it sucks not being able to see you.": "",
  "...Why do you say that?": "",
  "Well, that's just how I feel right now.": "",
  "Think about it. We've spent all this time opening up to each other, learning about each other... having fun...": "",
  "Losing that all of a sudden would really hurt.": "",
  "But then... what should we do?": "",
  "Why not what we've been doing: We encounter a calamity, we deal with it, we move on.": "",
  "So far that's been a pretty good system for us.": "",
  "But... surely you realize what we're dealing with...": "",
  "Yeah, and it's nothing we can't handle. After all... we're partners.": "",
  "A cow's got nothing on us.": "",
  "Or do you not trust me?": "",
  "Oh, come now! You know I do.": "",
  "In any case, now that you understand the source of your troubles, you shouldn't have to worry any longer.": "",
  "Instead, you can finally have some Amane time. Focus on being yourself and doing what you want to do. You know?": "",
  "...You're amazing, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I don't know how you do it, but you are. Truly.": "",
  "Nah, I'm always like this. Stressing's bad for your health.": "",
  "I see nothing that resembles a cow here.": "",
  "Ah, I'm sure there's nothing to be worried about regardless.": "",
  "Well then, let's get started.": "",
  "I shall put my heart and soul into this match.": "",
  "Good. Show me what you got.": "",
  "Want to play against me?": "",
  "...Oh, I don't consider it playing. This is war.": "",
  "All right, then let the battle begin.": "",
  "Nice! I won!": "",
  "And I... surrender.": "",
  "I'm impressed, Yagami-san. I'm usually quite dominant on the shogi board.": "",
  "Perhaps you have a power of your own... the power of observation.": "",
  "Well, I'm not a detective for nothing.": "",
  "Then it appears I've underestimated you.": "",
  "It appears as though I've won.": "",
  "Man... you routed me.": "",
  "I may have told you this already, but I'm usually quite dominant on the shogi board.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Correct.": "ถูกต้อง",
  "...What's this?": "...นี่มันคืออะไร?",
  "How much was it?": "แล้วมันราคาเท่าไหร่?",
  "Okay, I got it.": "โอเค เข้าใจแล้ว",
  "I was.": "เคยเป็นนะ"
 }
}
